<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Ambulance Emergency Tracking System</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: #005f5f; /* teal */
      --secondary-color: #017373;
      --accent-color: #01a999;
      --light-color: #e6f5f5;
      --text-color: #1b1b1b;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      --transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--light-color);
      color: var(--text-color);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #005f5f, #017373);
      color: white;
    }

    .intro-title {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .intro-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .intro-desc {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .auth-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: white;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      border: 2px solid white;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--accent-color);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      border: 2px solid white;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: white;
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .section {
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .member-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-align: center;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .member-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .member-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--accent-color);
    }

    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .feature-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #444;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1 class="intro-title"><i class="fas fa-ambulance"></i> Ambulance Emergency Tracking System</h1>
    <div class="intro-subtitle">Life-Saving Technology at Your Fingertips</div>
    <p class="intro-desc">
      Our system enables real-time ambulance tracking, efficient routing in traffic, and faster response during critical emergencies.
      Designed to reduce time, save lives, and deliver urgent medical support with precision.
    </p>
    <div class="auth-buttons">
      <a href="/map" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i> Track Ambulance</a>
      <a href="/adminlogin" class="btn btn-secondary"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> Admin Login</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Team - The Life Saviours</h2>
    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="member-card">
        <div class="member-name">Anuj Kumar</div>
      </div>
      <div class="member-card">
        <div class="member-name">Devansh Rawat</div>
      </div>
      <div class="member-card">
        <div class="member-name">Harri Agarawal</div>
      </div>
      <div class="member-card">
        <div class="member-name">Akanksha Negi</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Key Functionalities</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i></div>
        <div class="feature-title">Live Ambulance Location</div>
        <div class="feature-desc">Track ambulances in real-time with precise geo-location updates.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-traffic-light"></i></div>
        <div class="feature-title">Emergency Route Optimization</div>
        <div class="feature-desc">Dynamic routing to ensure the fastest path avoiding traffic congestion.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-hospital-user"></i></div>
        <div class="feature-title">Hospital Notification</div>
        <div class="feature-desc">Notify nearest hospitals before patient arrival for faster treatment.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
        <div class="feature-title">Secure Admin Panel</div>
        <div class="feature-desc">Manage ambulance availability and routes with secure access control.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
